NOTICE.md for attribution.

Build:

    go build -o warp-farm.exe .      # Windows
    go build -o warp-farm .          # Linux/macOS

Run:

    ./warp-farm.exe -size 8 -stack ipv6
    ./warp-farm.exe -size 8 -stack ipv6 -source-ipv6 2001:db8:1:2::/64

The gateway starts it for you when `WARP_FARM=1`; the checked-in binary is
ignored by git, so build it once per machine.
